    narr:generatedFrom "d47e17f24a950a0d71348dc45b695a3faf9b06c6" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative asks what a single expand must return so a position is seen within its context. The spine is [tight control of the expand unit — never a bare position, always under a call, narrative, or another door](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_9), grounded in [the actor hub as one level down: links to calls, narratives, positions, with the frame visible](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_8). Listing mechanics follow: [calls and narratives carry IRIs, everything beneath them is frames without IRIs](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_10). A fuller requirement states [a document page should show the whole graph inside it — narratives, positions, edges out, at navigational fidelity](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_11), bounded by [the 15K MCP page and the distinction between dumping navigation versus a large document to file](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_12), with [a long call as one expand result that may spill past the bell curve, no split](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_13). A [tentative landing — narrative shows calls as the unit of expansion, frames under them](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_15) stays provisional, and [a question whether the frame index's unit is the transaction, with too-much-data as the danger](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_36) keeps the alternative open. The register across children runs parallelism, anaphora, rule-of-three.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_10> ;
